{"seq":3,"slug":"layout-and-paint","title":"布局与绘制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/dom-and-cssom/layout-and-paint","wordCount":787,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"布局与绘制\">布局与绘制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>布局（Layout/Reflow）阶段基于渲染树构建<strong>布局树</strong>（过滤不可见元素，但包含伪元素），从根节点递归计算每个元素的精确位置与尺寸；绘制（Paint）阶段按<strong>背景 → 边框 → 子元素 → 轮廓</strong>的顺序生成绘制记录（Paint Records）。<strong>增量布局</strong>只重算 dirty 子树，而 <code>transform</code>/<code>opacity</code> 等合成属性变更既不触发布局也不触发绘制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从渲染树到布局树\">从渲染树到布局树</h2><p>样式计算完成后，浏览器会基于渲染树构建<strong>布局树（Layout Tree）</strong>。布局树只包含可见元素，<code>display: none</code> 的元素不会进入布局树，而 <code>::before</code>/<code>::after</code> 伪元素虽不在 DOM 中却会出现在布局树中。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    DOM[&quot;DOM 树&quot;] --&gt; Filter[&quot;过滤不可见元素&quot;]&#10;    CSSOM[&quot;CSSOM&quot;] --&gt; Filter&#10;    Filter --&gt; LayoutTree[&quot;布局树\\nLayout Tree&quot;]&#10;    LayoutTree --&gt; Box[&quot;生成盒模型\\nBox Generation&quot;]&#10;    Box --&gt; Position[&quot;计算位置与尺寸&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    DOM[\"DOM 树\"] --&gt; Filter[\"过滤不可见元素\"]\n    CSSOM[\"CSSOM\"] --&gt; Filter\n    Filter --&gt; LayoutTree[\"布局树\\nLayout Tree\"]\n    LayoutTree --&gt; Box[\"生成盒模型\\nBox Generation\"]\n    Box --&gt; Position[\"计算位置与尺寸\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"布局计算过程\">布局计算过程</h2><p>布局（Layout / Reflow）阶段从根节点开始，递归计算每个元素的精确几何信息。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface LayoutBox {&#10;  x: number;&#10;  y: number;&#10;  width: number;&#10;  height: number;&#10;  children: LayoutBox[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function getLayoutInfo(element: Element): LayoutBox {&#10;  const rect = element.getBoundingClientRect();&#10;  return {&#10;    x: rect.left,&#10;    y: rect.top,&#10;    width: rect.width,&#10;    height: rect.height,&#10;    children: Array.from(element.children).map(getLayoutInfo),&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;const body = document.body;&#10;console.log(JSON.stringify(getLayoutInfo(body), null, 2));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LayoutBox</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  width</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  height</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  children</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LayoutBox</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#